# The Weaviate Java client is not committed - see ../README.md for how to obtain it.
#
# It is a ~30 MB shaded jar, and how it should be distributed is an open question for
# this plugin (a p2-published org.jkiss.bundle.* wrapper would match how DBeaver handles
# other non-JDBC libraries). Keeping it out of git leaves that decision open, since a jar
# committed once stays in history for good.
*.jar
